{
  "key": 37243,
    "messages": [
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_CrossLogsOnBike",
            "en_US": [
                "You can zip across fallen logs like\n",
                "bridges on your Bike."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_ImNotStuck",
            "en_US": [
                "...Am I stuck in the bog?\r",
                "Of course not. How silly!\n",
                "This is a full-body mud pack.\r",
                "If it weren’t, I would be squirming\n",
                "and struggling to get out!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_HowAboutPokemonMansion",
            "en_US": [
                "You’ve been to the Great Marsh?\n",
                "How about the Pokémon Mansion?\r",
                "Wherever I go, I get to meet new and\n",
                "different Pokémon.\r",
                "I feel so privileged and happy about\n",
                "that."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_ConstantPatrol",
            "en_US": [
                "We’re on constant patrol.\n",
                "It’s safe here, even at night."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_SignPastoriaCity",
            "en_US": [
                "Rt. 212\n",
                "Pastoria City"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_SignShardsWanted",
            "en_US": [
                "Shards Wanted\n",
                "Pokémon Moves Taught"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_TrainerTipsBog",
            "en_US": [
                "Trainer Tips\r",
                "If you get stuck in the bog, you can\n",
                "count on being there a while.\r",
                "There’s no need to panic.\n",
                "Just struggle and squirm for a bit.\r",
                "Bicycles cannot be ridden on marshy\n",
                "ground, incidentally."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_PromotionalRouteCongrats",
            "en_US": [
                "Chapeau! It seems that you have\n",
                "beaten every trainer on Route 212!\f",
                "Here is your reward as promised.\r",
                "Would you like the Loaded Dice or\n",
                "5 Passho Berries?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_WatchOutForMorePromotions",
            "en_US": [
                "We’re getting more and more trainers\n",
                "battling with these promotions.\f",
                "Lady Jacinthe will be pleased.\r",
                "I wonder if she’ll come visit if we\n",
                "keep this up.\r",
                "Anyway, my next stop is Route 214.\n",
                "See you there, Champ."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_JulienTrainerCount",
            "en_US": [
                "Bonjour, Champ.\n",
                "Route 212 is our next promotional area.\r",
                "Only the trainers in the south part\n",
                "of the Route where it rains are\f",
                "required for this prize.\r",
                "This time the rewards are either\n",
                "Loaded Dice, or 5 Passho Berries.\r",
                "There are {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} Trainers left to\n",
                "face.\r",
                "Come see me when you’ve defeated them.\n"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "Route212South_Text_JulienTrainerCountSingular",
            "en_US": [
                "Bonjour, Champ.\n",
                "Route 212 is our next promotional area.\r",
                "Only the trainers in the south part\n",
                "of the Route where it rains are\n",
                "required for this prize.\r",
                "This time the rewards are either\f",
                "Loaded Dice, or 5 Passho Berries.\r",
                "There is {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} Trainer left to\n",
                "face.\r",
                "Come see me when you’ve defeated them.\n"
            ]
        }
    ]
}
